{
  "_comment": "Bluesky accounts and searches that scripts/social-leads.mjs scans for job and award leads (TASKS/jobs.md and TASKS/grants.md, 'Social-media leads'). Posts are leads only: every record needs its official page. Add an account only after reading its profile; an impostor account wastes a run but cannot put facts in the data.",
